## Beads

Issue prefix: `{{ issue_prefix }}`. Label: `{{ beads_label }}`.

Issues created in this repo are automatically labeled via `config.yaml`.
`bd list` filters to this repo's issues automatically. `bd ready` requires `--label-any repo:{{ beads_label }}` in bd 1.0+.

```text
bd ready                    Show issues ready to work
bd list --status=open       All open issues
bd show <id>                View issue details
bd update <id> --claim      Claim work
bd close <id>               Mark complete
bd create --title="..." --description="..." --type=task --priority=2 --labels="{{ beads_label }}"
```
